v1.0.0 — 2026-11-23
--------------------
- Initial public release of the Frostline skin for WeeWX v5.
- Responsive dark/light dashboard (`Auto`, `Dark`, and `Light`) with FOUC-free theme switching.
- Multi-page layout: Dashboard (`index.html`), interactive Chart.js v4 + offline Canvas fallback Charts (`charts.html`), All-Time/Year/Month/Today Records (`records.html`), What to Wear (`wear.html` with optional Running Kit and SAR 12-hour callout cards), and multi-sensor Station diagnostics (`station.html`).
- International units support (`rain_units`, `tide_units`, `aqi_standard`), US NWS & Environment Canada Weather Alerts, Open-Meteo Hourly/7-Day forecasts & Air Quality, Windy radar embed, and DFO IWLS / NOAA CO-OPS / lunar harmonic tide predictions.
- Packaged as a WeeWX v5 extension (`install.py`) defaulting `HTML_ROOT` to `public_html/frostline`.
